<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom hits high for 96.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom hits high for 96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom shares hit a new high for 1996 of 4,187 escudos and could surpass 4,200 soon, amid heavy buying by foreign investors, dealers said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a lot of interest among foreign investors and PT could well break through 4,200 escudos,&quot; said one operator.</p>
<p>PT later eased to 4,182 escudos, up 12, in high volume of 370,058 shares.  </p>
<p>&quot;The buying of PT shares is due to confidence in the company's fundamentals,&quot; said another dealer.</p>
<p>-- Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
